            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 13:45:00 +1000</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>ScoreSort 1.5.1</h2>
                <p>A small polish update:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Expanded the Welcome Tour</b> — clearer guidance for combining (images, blank pages, table of contents) and splitting, including A3 sheet splitting and booklet reordering.</li>
                    <li><b>Tidied the default window size</b> and minor UI refinements.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
